# Build/dependency trees. A committed virtualenv (md-to-pdf/.venv-pdf) once
# grew this repo to 3432 tracked files -- 3312 of them site-packages, 101 MB
# on disk -- and every branch merge then conflicted on hundreds of identical
# vendored LICENSE files, because git pairs them up as renames.
.venv*/
venv/
env/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/

# Editor/extension build output
extension_vs_code_glass/out/
*.vsix
